Deploy nudge marker.

Touched to trigger a clean 'Deploy to GitHub Pages' run. A re-run of a
failed run reuses the same run id, and upload-pages-artifact ADDS a second
artifact named 'github-pages' rather than replacing it, which makes
deploy-pages@v4 fail with 'Multiple artifacts named github-pages were
unexpectedly found'. A new run gets a fresh artifact namespace.

Last nudge: 2026-08-06T08:59:48-0400
